      "text": "==============================================================================================='\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t'\n       \t                 \t\t       Robocop\t     \t\t\t                \t\t\t'\n         \t              \t\t        Data East (1989)            \t \t\t                '\n\t  \t\t\t\t  \t  www.ipdb.org/machine.cgi?id=1976                                  '\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t'\n\t  \t\t \t \t  \tCreated by ICPjuggla, Talantyyr, Dozer316 and dark \t\t                '\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t'\n==============================================================================================='\n\nModified by drakkon, version 1.1\n\n1.2 - Updates:\n-Added FlexDMD support, thanks to scutters for adding feature\n'\n1.1 - Updates:\n-Adjusted captive ball pegs - were too close to each other causing shots to miss\n-Fixed plunger lane bug - was falling off wire ramp if plunge was soft and stopped midway\n  -Added relay sound to flasher solenoid callback\n\n1.0 - Updates, Initial Release:\n-nFozzy physics\n-Fleep mechanical sounds\n-Added shadow to flippers, ball shadow (No other visual updates, all original)\n-LUT selection added (Includes Robocop Original selection)\n\n==============================================================================================="
    }
  ],
